Date: Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:45:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: repair broken build config, dead FIFA README merge,
 and wire frontend to working backend

Not tagged [Bob:*] -- this pass was done with Claude, not an IBM Bob
session. Re-tag/re-log through Bob separately if that's required for
submission credit.

Build-breaking fixes:
- next.config.ts is unsupported on Next.js 14 (requires 15+); both
  'npm run build' and 'npm run lint' failed immediately. Replaced with
  next.config.mjs and dropped the invalid i18n block (App Router
  doesn't support Next's built-in i18n config anyway; lib/i18n.ts
  already handles this).
- Added missing .eslintrc.json -- eslint-config-next was a declared
  dependency but no config existed, so 'next lint' prompted
  interactively instead of running.
- Fixed a TS2769 type error in lib/crypto.ts (WebCrypto BufferSource
  vs Uint8Array<ArrayBufferLike> mismatch under current @types/node).

Docs:
- README.md: reverted the football/FIFA World Cup positioning merged
  in via docs/screenwriter-submission, which contradicted CHARTER.md
  and AGENT.md and left unfilled template placeholders and duplicated
  sections committed to main. Restored one coherent doc with an honest
  'Current Prototype Status' table.

Frontend wiring (was 100% static mockup, zero API calls anywhere):
- upload/page.tsx: real onChange/drop handling, calls the real
  /api/scripts/upload endpoint, shows parsed result.
- storyboard/page.tsx: fetches real parsed scene data and a real
  budget estimate; storyboard image cells are honestly labeled
  in-progress rather than faked, since /api/generate/storyboard is
  still a stub.
- judge/page.tsx: pipeline status now reflects real upload/parse/
  budget state instead of every step being hardcoded 'Pending'.
- lib/api.ts: ScriptUploadResponse was missing title/language/
  scene_count (the fields the backend actually returns); added
  getParsedScript(). Added lib/session.ts to pass script_id between
  pages.

Cleanup:
- requirements.txt: removed duplicate httpx==0.27.0 pin.
- generate.py: removed unused HTTPException import (ruff F401).
- Renamed malformed bob-log filename (docsbob-log2026-07-21-... ->
  2026-07-21-...).

Verified: 225/225 backend tests still pass, ruff clean, tsc --noEmit
clean, next lint clean. Production build not verified in this sandbox
(no network access to fonts.googleapis.com for next/font) -- verify
'npm run build' locally before recording the demo.
